stateDiagram-v2
    state "No media" as NoMedia
    state "Reset media session" as Resetting
    state "Current media session" as Session
    state "Loading" as Loading
    state "Ready, not playing" as Ready
    state "Playing" as Playing
    state "Paused" as Paused
    state "End of media" as Ended
    state "Media error" as MediaError
    [*] --> NoMedia
    NoMedia --> Resetting: Playlist has media, select first item
    Resetting --> Session: Nonempty source, create session via queued C++ callback
    Resetting --> NoMedia: Empty source
    state Session {
        [*] --> Loading
        Loading --> Ready: Media ready, no pending Play
        Loading --> Playing: Media ready, pending Play, backend confirms Playing
        Ready --> Playing: Play, backend confirms Playing
        Playing --> Paused: Pause, backend confirms Paused
        Paused --> Playing: Play, backend confirms Playing
        Playing --> Ended: EOS handled after the current callback
        Ended --> Playing: Auto Next off, Play requests seek to zero and replay
        Loading --> MediaError: Media rejected
        Ready --> MediaError: Backend error
        Playing --> MediaError: Backend error
        Paused --> MediaError: Backend error
    }
    Session --> Resetting: Track selection or Next / Previous
    Ended --> Resetting: Auto Next on, select next track and request Play
    Session --> NoMedia: Mount lost or playlist has no media
    note right of Ended
        Auto Next off retains the session and final frame.
        Auto Next on advances with playlist wraparound.
    end note
    note right of Resetting
        Stop the old source before creating a new session.
        Generation checks reject obsolete callbacks.
    end note
